---
// Sección 9 rúbrica — "Cierre"
//
// Rediseñado: menos bloques apilados, jerarquía visual clara.
// Estructura: hero-line del cierre → CTA hero card grande con los 2
// botones + hook line integrado → footer con datos del evento + mapa
// en una sola tarjeta horizontal.
---

<section class="final" id="contacto">
  <div class="wrap">

    <!-- Hero-line del cierre -->
    <header class="final-lead">
      <div class="final-eyebrow">HORA DE DECIDIR</div>
      <h2>
        El futuro de la movilidad se decide
        <em>antes de llegar a la calle.</em>
      </h2>
      <p>
        La congestión no tiene por qué enfrentarse mediante ensayo y error.
        Con Troppo, las decisiones pueden probarse, medirse y optimizarse en un
        entorno digital antes de llevarlas a la realidad.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- CTA hero card -->
    <div class="final-cta">
      <div class="final-cta-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="final-cta-inner">
        <span class="final-cta-tag">¿TIENES ALGÚN DESAFÍO DE MOVILIDAD?</span>
        <h3>
          Hoy comenzamos en el puerto.
          <span class="final-cta-h3-em">Mañana, en tu infraestructura.</span>
        </h3>
        <p>Tomas la decisión, nos llamas, elegimos el lugar y simulamos. Mañana lo llevamos a la realidad.</p>
        <div class="final-cta-actions">
          <a href="#demo" class="final-btn final-btn-primary">
            <span>Conoce nuestro proyecto</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M3 8 L13 8" />
              <path d="M9 4 L13 8 L9 12" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#equipo" class="final-btn final-btn-ghost">
            <span>Conoce nuestro equipo</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M3 8 L13 8" />
              <path d="M9 4 L13 8 L9 12" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Datos del evento + mapa (tarjeta horizontal única) -->
    <div class="final-event">
      <div class="event-info">
        <div class="event-tag">
          <span class="event-tag-dot"></span>
          <span>34.ª FERIA DE SOFTWARE USM</span>
        </div>
        <h4>USM Campus San Joaquín</h4>
        <p class="event-address">Av. Vicuña Mackenna 3939 · San Joaquín, Santiago</p>
        <div class="event-meta">
          <div>
            <span class="event-meta-label">Fecha</span>
            <span class="event-meta-val">13 de noviembre, 2026</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="event-map">
        <iframe
          src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=-33.4905109,-70.6190188&hl=es&z=17&output=embed"
          title="USM Campus San Joaquín · Av. Vicuña Mackenna 3939"
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          allowfullscreen
        ></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .final {
    padding: 110px 0 130px;
    background: rgba(4, 69, 89, 0.85);
    color: var(--cream);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  /* ============ HEAD ============ */
  .final-lead {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto 56px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .final-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    color: var(--cyan);
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .final-lead h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 46px;
    line-height: 1.13;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.6px;
  }
  .final-lead h2 em {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--cyan);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .final-lead p {
    margin: 22px auto 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.78);
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  /* ============ CTA CARD (hero de la sección) ============ */
  .final-cta {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto 72px;
    border-radius: 28px;
    overflow: hidden;
    isolation: isolate;
  }
  /* Glow gradient de fondo — sensación de "hero card" */
  .final-cta-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(90% 60% at 20% 0%, rgba(97, 225, 230, 0.22), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(80% 60% at 100% 100%, rgba(209, 235, 120, 0.12), transparent 65%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(4, 69, 89, 0.55), rgba(3, 53, 68, 0.85));
    z-index: -1;
  }
  .final-cta-inner {
    padding: 54px 56px 52px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(97, 225, 230, 0.32);
    border-radius: 28px;
    text-align: center;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }
  .final-cta-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    background: rgba(97, 225, 230, 0.14);
    border: 1px solid rgba(97, 225, 230, 0.4);
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--cyan);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .final-cta h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .final-cta-h3-em {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--cyan);
    font-weight: 500;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .final-cta p {
    margin: 20px auto 32px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.75);
    max-width: 560px;
  }
  .final-cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .final-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      transform 260ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
      box-shadow 260ms ease,
      background 260ms ease,
      border-color 260ms ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .final-btn svg {
    transition: transform 260ms cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
  }
  .final-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .final-btn:hover svg {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .final-btn-primary {
    background: var(--lime);
    color: var(--navy-deep);
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .final-btn-primary:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(209, 235, 120, 0.4);
  }
  .final-btn-ghost {
    background: rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.06);
    color: var(--cream);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.32);
  }
  .final-btn-ghost:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.12);
    border-color: rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.55);
  }

  /* ============ EVENT INFO + MAP (tarjeta horizontal) ============ */
  .final-event {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.14);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 8px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .event-info {
    padding: 24px 26px;
  }
  .event-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--cyan);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    opacity: 0.95;
  }
  .event-tag-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--cyan);
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--cyan);
    animation: event-tag-pulse 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes event-tag-pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    50% { opacity: 0.35; transform: scale(0.75); }
  }
  .event-info h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .event-address {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.72);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .event-meta {
    margin-top: 22px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .event-meta > div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }
  .event-meta-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.4px;
    color: rgba(97, 225, 230, 0.85);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .event-meta-val {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--cream);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .event-map {
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgba(255, 248, 234, 0.04);
    min-height: 220px;
  }
  .event-map iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
    display: block;
    filter: saturate(0.85);
  }

  /* --- MOBILE --- */
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .final { padding: 80px 0 100px; }
    .final-lead { margin-bottom: 44px; }
    .final-lead h2 { font-size: 30px; }
    .final-lead p { font-size: 14.5px; }
    .final-cta { margin-bottom: 52px; }
    .final-cta-inner { padding: 36px 24px 34px; }
    .final-cta h3 { font-size: 24px; }
    .final-cta p { font-size: 14px; margin: 16px auto 26px; }
    .final-btn { padding: 12px 18px; font-size: 13px; }
    .final-event {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .event-info h4 { font-size: 20px; }
    .event-map { min-height: 200px; }
  }
</style>
